# Generated coverage reports.
#
# 151 of these were tracked (4.7 MB of HTML across five packages) because
# nothing ignored them. Beyond the diff noise on every `--coverage` run, a
# committed report is actively misleading: `git grep` returns its inlined
# source with stale "statement not covered" annotations, as if those were
# claims about the code today.
coverage/
